        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Schiff, David Shore, Daniel Dae Kim\n- TV Series: The Good Doctor\n- Companies: ABC, 3AD\n- Roles: Dr. Glassman\n- Places: San José, California\n- Concepts: South Korean series adaptations, medical-drama television\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, the South Korean series that The Good Doctor is based on was released.\n- The Good Doctor is an American medical-drama television series developed by David Shore.\n- Daniel Dae Kim runs the film and television production company 3AD.\n- 3AD is producing the television series The Good Doctor.\n- In September 2017, Richard Schiff was set to begin appearing in a leading role on ABC's prime time drama series The Good Doctor.\n- In The Good Doctor, Richard Schiff plays Dr. Glassman, the president of a fictional teaching hospital in San José, California.",
